SUMMARY:Sonoma Con 2026
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma County’s premier gaming convention returns for its third year. Become a part of a passionate community of gamers\, collectors\, and hobbyists for a weekend of games\, art\, pop culture\, comics\, card games\, tournaments and more. Sonoma Con features competitive card game tournaments for Magic: The Gathering and Flesh and Blood\, A live Dungeons and Dragons experience\, as well as free\, expo-style activities for all ages. Sonoma Con also features a wide array of artists and vendors\, from international stars to local favorites. Cosplay is highly encouraged\, as is participation in our 2nd annual cosplay parade and contest. For additional information\, please visit sonoma-con.com
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/sonoma-con-2026-2/
LOCATION:Sonoma County Fairgrounds\, 1350 Bennett Valley Road\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Other
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://golocal.coop/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Sonoma-Con-Oct-s.jpg
END:VEVENT
