SUMMARY:Celestial Sips: Stargazing in the Vineyard
DESCRIPTION:Dry Creek Vineyard\nFriday\, October 9\, 2026\n6 – 9 p.m.\n21 & Older Only \nEnjoy an enchanting evening under the stars in the heart of Dry Creek Valley. With guidance from Robert Ferguson Observatory\, take in the Draconid meteor shower and learn to spot constellations overhead. \nEnjoy acoustic guitar by Brian Emory and a comforting\, elevated dinner by the Brunch Boys\, featuring Cornish game hens\, truffle mac & cheese and seasonal greens\, paired with Dry Creek Vineyard wine. \nRelax\, sip and look skyward!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/celestial-sips-stargazing-in-the-vineyard/
LOCATION:Dry Creek Vineyard\, 3770 Lambert Bridge Road\, Healdsburg\, CA
CATEGORIES:Other
END:VEVENT
