SUMMARY:An Evening with the Rush Tribute Project
DESCRIPTION:The Rush Tribute Project is an homage to one of the most enduring and influential bands in rock music. Combining skilled musicianship with exciting performances\, The Rush Tribute Project (known as RTP to its dedicated fanbase) painstakingly recreates the sound and energy that made Rush one of the top-selling rock bands of all time. Using vintage instruments\, multi-camera projection\, state-of-the-art lighting & lasers\, and signature virtuosity\, RTP will be performing two full sets of music\, including Moving Pictures in its entirety\, as well as deep cuts like “La Villa Strangiato” and “Enter Nous.” \nHaving performed for more than a decade across North America and around the world\, including RushCon\, RTP stands as one of the premiere tributes to this legendary rock ‘n’ roll power trio. \nPlatinum Tickets are tickets that are dynamically priced up and down based on demand. Platinum Tickets are not part of VIP packages – they are tickets only. \nPlatinum Seating provides fans with direct access to securing some of the best seats in the venue at market value. The market value for Platinum Seating is subject to change based on the overall demand and popularity for the event.  Platinum Seating allows fans to purchase tickets in a safe and secure environment without running the risk of purchasing tickets that may be considered lost\, stolen\, or counterfeit.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/an-evening-with-the-rush-tribute-project/
LOCATION:Luther Burbank Center for the Arts\, 50 Mark West Springs Road\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
END:VEVENT
