SUMMARY:Saturday Live Music at Spicy Vines feat. Take 3 Jazz Trio
DESCRIPTION:Where unforgettable wines\, live music\, and good vibes come together. \nJoin us every Saturday from 3–6 PM at Spicy Vines for a tasting room experience like no other — where top local musicians from across the Bay Area meet our award-winning small-lot wines. From Rock & Roll and Blues to Jazz\, Bluegrass\, and Americana\, each weekend brings new sounds and new reasons to raise a glass. \nTake 3 Jazz Trio\nTake 3 Jazz Trio is an all-women Bay Area ensemble performing tunes from the Great American Song Book. We play a mix of uplifting swing tunes\, smooth Latin tunes\, and soulful blues and ballads. Michele Korb is our vocalist/guitarist. Susanne DiVincenzo is on bass. Barb Raboy plays clarinet\, sax\, and flute. \nDetails\nNo cover. Walk-ins are welcome\, but this event tends to fill up quickly\, so we recommend making a reservation. We are dog and family friendly!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/saturday-live-music-at-spicy-vines-feat-take-3-jazz-trio/
LOCATION:Spicy Vines\, 441 Healdsburg Ave.\, Healdsburg\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
END:VEVENT
